(
  id: "scn_m08_washita_aftermath",
  display_name: "Washita Aftermath",
  briefing: [
    "Five days later, survivors carry a winter count naming the missing, the dead, and the children taken away. Teague wants it destroyed because two Ring scouts appear among the paid auxiliaries.",
    "The witnesses are moving east through deep snow. Doyle has found a route, but riders are closing both ends of the draw.",
    "Escort the witnesses out. The winter count is not evidence until its keepers survive to speak.",
  ],
  prebattle_dialogue: [
    (speaker:"Doyle", text:"The east draw is ugly, narrow, and still our best chance.", voice:Some("m08_01_doyle.wav")),
    (speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"Ugly is a road. Dead is an ending. Take the draw.", voice:Some("m08_02_naomi.wav")),
    (speaker:"Doyle", text:"Keep the witnesses in the middle. We are the walls until the draw opens.", voice:None),
    (speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"Nobody breaks formation to settle a score. The list reaches the fire with us.", voice:None),
  ],
  battle_dialogue: [
    (id:"m08_move", trigger:"first_player_move", speaker:"Doyle", text:"Step by step. The draw is narrow, but it is still a road home."),
    (id:"m08_shot", trigger:"first_player_shot", speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"Make room for the witnesses. Every shot must buy them another pace."),
    (id:"m08_hit", trigger:"first_enemy_hit", speaker:"Doyle", text:"Hold the line. Wounded or not, nobody leaves the center alone."),
    (id:"m08_down", trigger:"first_enemy_down", speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"The ambush is thinning. Keep the list moving."),
  ],
  score: Some("winter_count.wav"),
  date: "1868-12-01",
